shortdesc Cite classic works
longdesc The package provides a basic framework to cite classic works
longdesc (specially from authors such as Homer, Plato, Aristotle,
longdesc Descartes, Hume, and Kant) in accordance with traditional
longdesc pagination systems. It may be used in conjunction with other
longdesc citation packages.
